OL,5,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FAction-packed observational
OL,7,     Fdocumentary series with Jamie
OL,8,     FTheakston. In 2017-18, there were
OL,9,     F27 fatal police-related road
OL,10,     Ftraffic incidents, resulting in 29
OL,11,     Ffatalities.
OL,12,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FJason stops a drugged-up driver
OL,14,     Fwho does 70 mph in a 30 zone to
OL,15,     Ftry and evade capture.
OL,16,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,17,     FFirearms officers enter a property
OL,18,     Fto discover an arsenal of weapons
OL,19,     Fand a recently harvested cannabis
OL,20,     Fcrop, and suspicions are aroused
OL,21,     Fby a lad in a balaclava on a sunny
OL,22,     Fday.
